message: "If you use this research artifact, please cite this repository release."
title: "CGLMP5 exact quantum value — Lean formalization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lin
    given-names: Dehao
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-4551-8490"
version: 0.2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/LeoLam233/cglmp5-exact-value"
abstract: >-
  AI-assisted exact proof artifact and Lean formalization of the quantum maximum
  of the standard five-outcome CGLMP Bell inequality, for arbitrary local Hilbert
  spaces and tensor-product five-outcome POVMs, with an exact positive
  noncommutative sum-of-squares certificate and full five-dimensional bipartite
  attainment. Release acceptance is documented by separate same-tree kernel,
  reproducibility, adversarial-audit, CI and remote-verification receipts.
